    "searchCoverage": "Official Nango Cloud REST API is HTTPS to api.nango.dev with Authorization Bearer environment API keys. GET /providers is the documented catalog probe used by the pinned credential validator and is used as healthcheck. GET /providers/{provider}, GET /integrations, and GET /connections are documented reads. Writes, credential-bearing get-connection, and object tags query filters are omitted. Self-hosted Nango is a different edition; this recipe pins the documented cloud host. Operator is Nango Inc in the United States. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no qualifying unresolved platform compromise. Bounded coverage is not a breach-free claim.",
